OL,4,G1800FWords and Music
OL,5,     GMusic by Berlioz, Virgil Thomson
OL,6,     Gand Tchaikovsky inspired by
OL,7,     GByron's poetry, and readings by
OL,8,     GRobert Glenister from his
OL,9,     Gwritings, in today's programme
OL,10,     Gcelebrating Byron .
OL,11,G1915FSunday Feature: Wolf Biermann -
OL,12,     FGerman Bob Dylan exiled from the
OL,13,     FGDR
OL,14,     GUncovering the events that led to
OL,15,     Gprotest singer Wolf Biermann -
OL,16,     Ghailed as the German Bob Dylan
OL,17,     Gand long living under house
OL,18,     Garrest - to be exiled from the
OL,19,     GGDR.
